	(text "Bulk: 6 × 10 µF 100 V X7R 1210 + 3 × 100 nF 100 V here, + C102 (10 µF) and the 22 µF 100 V can on the\npower sheet; ~28 µF effective MLCC at 48 V DC bias. Slots beside each leg at layout."
