	(text "Power-stage notes\n• Q: BSC030N08NS5, 80 V, 3.0 mΩ, Qg 76 nC, SuperSO8.\n• Shunts 1 mΩ: 15 A RMS → 0.23 W; 80 A burst → 6.4 W (check pulse curve).\n• CSA input range ±0.3 V diff, ±0.15 V common mode.\n• Kelvin: SP_x/SN_x run as a pair from the shunt pads\n  to the DRV, never shared with the power path.\n• SHx = PHASE_x: dedicated trace to the HS source."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "86d6d2d2-8edc-5244-9b7f-71849b8c618c")
	)
